# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party vendor material - deliberately NOT redistributed.
#
# SDK/ contains the Entrust/Datacard "XPS Card Printer Driver SDK" sample code,
# compiled vendor executables and documentation. Those files carry
# "Copyright (c) Datacard Corporation. All Rights Reserved." and are licensed
# separately, so they must not be published with this project. The application
# does NOT need them to build: the printer integration talks to the Windows
# print spooler (BidiSpl COM + GDI) and only *quotes* schema names documented in
# the SDK header, it never includes an SDK file.
#
# A developer who wants the SDK for reference should obtain it from the printer
# vendor. If you hold redistribution rights, remove the two lines below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SDK/
528182-001f-xps-driver-sdk-v8-7-release-notes.pdf
